; xfail: which is planned after this module
;
; Regression (2026-09-24): a module-level constant is planned in module
; DECLARATION order, so a module reading one from a LATER module is rc 4
; `unknown identifier`. The hint used to say "add: use <path>" -- and adding
; that use changes nothing (measured). It names the order now, and the two
; fixes (Planner.use_vis_hint#, concept_is_constant#); a constant of ANOTHER
; package inside a module gets its own wording (package_dir_of#).
module xfail_later_const_reader
module later_const_helper

print "`twice_limit()`"
